# Mateos Pet AI Rules

## Stack
- Node.js
- Express
- Prisma
- React
- TailwindCSS

## General Rules
- Never break existing functionality
- Always explain important changes
- Prefer reusable components
- Use clean architecture
- Keep code readable and maintainable

## Backend Rules
- Controllers must stay thin
- Business logic belongs in services
- Use async/await
- Use try/catch in controllers
- Validate request bodies
- Use REST conventions
- Never access Prisma directly from routes

## Frontend Rules
- Use functional React components
- Avoid inline styles
- Use responsive layouts
- Prefer reusable UI components
- Keep components modular

## Prisma Rules
- Never generate destructive migrations automatically
- Preserve schema compatibility
- Prefer explicit relations

## File Editing Rules
- Do not modify unrelated files
- Preserve existing comments unless obsolete
- Keep naming consistent

## Important
- Before large refactors, explain the plan first
- Prefer minimal safe changes